{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-branching-qvalue-factorization","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:branching-qvalue-factorization","kind":"proposition","title":"Exact factorization of the branching Q-value","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-spectator-normalization"],"tags":["factorization","q-value","character-sum","exact","branching"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","text":"branching-qvalue-factorization.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:branching-qvalue-factorization\"></a><p>Compute the branching <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{Q}_q</code>-value by summing over all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4^A</code> channel configurations.</p>\n<h2>Statement</h2>\n<p><em>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^-</code> decay of a nucleus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(Z, N)</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A = Z + N</code>:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\sum_{\\text{all } 4^A \\text{ configs}}\n  \\Delta m_e\n  = a^Z \\cdot b^{N-1} \\cdot (a - b)</code></pre>\n<p><em>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code> are the per-nucleon channel sums.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/branching-qvalue-factorization.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"14.10.6","page":"b/prop-branching-qvalue-factorization","qa":{"counts":{"pass":92,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":78},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:HeckeTemperleyLieb.branching_qvalue_factorization","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/HeckeTemperleyLieb/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
